eight=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/Gianthold_Tor\" title=\"Gianthold Tor\">Gianthold Tor</a></b>, <a href=\"/page/Grundaussir\" title=\"Grundaussir\">White Dragon</a>'s chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spot\" title=\"Spot\">Spot +13</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spot\" title=\"Spot\">Spot +13</a>:</b> Passive: +13 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to the <a href=\"/page/Spot\" title=\"Spot\">Spot</a> skill.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Secret_Door_Detection\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Secret Door Detection\">Secret Door Detection</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Secret_Door_Detection\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Secret Door Detection\">Secret Door Detection</a>:</b> This item will automatically reveal <a href=\"/page/Secret_door\" title=\"Secret door\">secret doors</a> with a DC of 20 or less.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\"> Wisdom +2</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\"> Wisdom +2</a></b>: This item makes the wearer more in tune with her surroundings, granting a +2 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Wisdom.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Intricate_Field_Optics_(historic).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Intricate_Field_Optics_%28historic%29.png/420px-Intricate_Field_Optics_%28historic%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"286\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Intricate_Field_Optics_%28historic%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>These field optics are of too precise a workmanship for the ancient giants to have created them. They must have been assembled by elven artisans in the presence of a giant master.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p><br />\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817045512\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.071 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.117 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3395/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20828/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5039/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n136.57%  136.302     42 Template:IO\n100.00%   99.804      1 -total\n 90.85%   90.669      1 Template:Named_item\n 88.47%   88.298      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 45.31%   45.225      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 44.49%   44.404      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 43.60%   43.512      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 42.70%   42.615      2 Template:InCategory\n 21.30%   21.258      5 Template:Popup\n 16.34%   16.306      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:11115-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817045512 and revision id 631571. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"
